Subject: [PATCH 4/5] =?UTF-8?q?feat(playback-capture):=20isServiceRunning?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20real=20=E2=80=94=20MainActivity=20ya=20no=20asume=20"detenid?=
 =?UTF-8?q?o"=20a=20ciegas?=
